There are many ways to convert a string to an array. The simplest way is to use thetoCharArray()method:

Explanation:The methodtoCharArray()turns the string into an array of characters.  
Each letter of"Hello"becomes one element in the array, somyArray[0]isH.

You can also loop through the array to print all array elements:

Explanation:The loop goes through each element in the array and prints it.  
So for"Hello", it prints the letters one by one: H, e, l, l, o.

